The files under `tokenizer/` are the tokenizer tests of html5lib-tests
(https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests), at commit
c777c408b61078ea2eb4acefc2535f54dbc8b28a, retrieved on 2026-10-06: every `.test` file of its
`tokenizer` directory, each copied byte for byte. Its `README.md`, which describes the format, and
the rest of the repository are left out.

html5lib-tests is distributed under the licence below, as its `LICENSE` gives it.

